 analyses of U.S. auto fuel economy standards","a":["Antonio M. Bento","Kenneth Gillingham","Mark R. Jacobsen","Christopher R. Knittel","Benjamin Leard","Joshua Linn","Virginia McConnell","David Rapson","James M. Sallee","Arthur A. van Benthem","Kate S. Whitefoot"],"y":2018,"c":"pub","j":"Science","v":"362","i":"6419","p":"1119-1121","r":139,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aav1458","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1126/science.aav1458"},{"t":"The Rebound Effect and Energy Efficiency Policy","a":["Kenneth Gillingham","David Rapson","Gernot Wagner"],"y":2016,"c":"pub","j":"Review of Environmental Economics and Policy","v":"10","i":"1","p":"68-88","r":68,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1093/reep/rev017","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1093/reep/rev017"},{"t":"Commercial and Industrial Demand Response Under Mandatory Time‐of‐Use Electricity Pricing","a":["Katrina Jessoe","David Rapson"],"y":2015,"c":"pub","j":"Journal of Industrial Economics","v":"63","i":"3","p":"397-421","r":29,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1111/joie.12082","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1111/joie.12082"},{"t":"Towards understanding the role of price in residential electricity choices: Evidence from a natural experiment","a":["Katrina Jessoe","David Rapson","Jeremy B. Smith"],"y":2014,"c":"pub","j":"Journal of Economic Behavior and Organization","v":"107","p":"191-208","r":52,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jebo.2014.03.009","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1016/j.jebo.2014.03.009"},{"t":"Durable goods and long-run electricity demand: Evidence from air conditioner purchase behavior","a":["David Rapson"],"y":2014,"c":"pub","j":"Journal of Environmental Economics and Management","v":"68","i":"1","p":"141-160","r":32,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jeem.2014.04.003","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1016/j.jeem.2014.04.003"},{"t":"Knowledge is (Less) Power: Experimental Evidence from Residential Energy Use","a":["Katrina Jessoe","David Rapson"],"y":2014,"c":"pub","j":"American Economic Review","v":"104","i":"4","p":"1417-1438","r":0,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1257/aer.104.4.